      "content": "That feeling of being trapped inside a system where nothing truly changes is incredibly heavy, and it's okay to acknowledge that the current reality is painful. No single action will instantly break free from a corporate machine, but stepping away from your voice would only make you feel smaller within your own life. Sometimes the most powerful act of control is simply refusing to sell your heart for a paycheck, even if the consequences feel impossible right now. You deserve to live in a way that honors who you are rather than just the role you play.",
